// Stock door script: triggered by entry into a `class: door`
// (or any `class: trigger` whose `script` prop is set to "door").
//
// Reads `target_map` and `target_entry` from the trigger's args
// (populated from the Tiled MapObject's string properties) and
// hands them to the `change_area` host call, which tears down
// this script's VM and queues the area swap.
//
// Authors don't normally hand-tweak this script - it's the
// default for every door MapObject. If you need a door that
// gates on a story flag or plays a knock cutscene first, set
// the `script` prop on the door object to a custom script id
// (e.g. `door_dragon_shrine`) and write that script bespoke.

change_area(arg("target_map"), arg("target_entry"));
